Link destination parentheses balance

```
[x](http://a/b(c))
.
<p><a href="http://a/b(c)">x</a></p>
```

```
[x](a(b(c))d) and [y](e)f)
.
<p><a href="a(b(c))d">x</a> and <a href="e">y</a>f)</p>
```

```
[x](http://a/b\)c) and [y](a\\b) and [z](a\qb)
.
<p><a href="http://a/b)c">x</a> and <a href="a\b">y</a> and <a href="a\qb">z</a></p>
```

```
[t](url
more)
.
<p>[t](url
more)</p>
```
